{# palette.knap: ratchet eval fixture (lane MD-PAL). A block palette: each
   `sections` item carries a server-picked `kind`, and the template owns
   how every kind renders. The model never sees this chain; it is handed
   one kind and fills only that kind's fields. #}{{ title | h1 }}

